Z||000004||RobertVol||08-12-2001||10:39 PM||||Havent been around awhile but had to respond and give credit where credit is due..<P>Rodney Dickman<BR>Paul Vargys<BR>FieroStore<P>All us Fiero owners.. Duh! IF we didnt buy the cars and pay the for the parts our vendors wouldn't be in business<P>Guys like Cliff Pennock, Doug Kinney, Rodney Dickman ..Again! uh <P>All the small shops and clubs that keep the locals in their cars running well.<P>The people who host the club meets and do the organization of them for all of us to go to and meet other owners..<P>Did I miss anything?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT 56k T TOP  <BR>North Florida Fiero Club<P><A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/RobsGT2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
