Z||000015||Dave Gunsul||08-13-2001||09:21 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Alex4mula:<BR><B><BR>2.  There was also a guy called Matt Gruber (or similar) that had a very nice newsletter in late 80s/early 90s. Don't know what happened to him. That one helped me a lot also on mods and fixes by that time.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I was going to mention Matt too but figured that I was probably one of the only ones that remembers his "Fiero News" news letter.<BR>Some of you have asked where I have read all these old articles from and now you know one<BR>of my sources from the time when the Fiero was new. Some of the old FOCOA mags are very interesting too, especially when you read the<BR>ones where Fiero Phil Huff is bashing Matt<BR>because he's the only other game in town for the Fiero owners of the time.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
